cirrusconfig (0.1-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * kiosk: launch KIP alone on the DSI when HDMI is unplugged, and read each
    screen's real origin from xrandr instead of pinning the DSI window to 1920,0
  * setup-screens: map the DSI touchscreen in the single-screen branch too
    (TOUCH_DSI was only assigned in the dual-screen branch)
  * add wifi-watchdog, recovering wlan0 when the supplicant sticks on
    CTRL-EVENT-ASSOC-REJECT (88 retries over 16 minutes observed on 2026-07-24)
  * cirrus-certs: order after time-sync.target so certificates are not stamped
    with a 1970 notBefore on a Pi with no RTC battery
  * ship signalk-ensure-ssl.sh, the signalk systemd drop-ins, the chromium.d
    fragment and test-ps5-controller.sh, all previously missing from the package

 -- Matthieu Laborie <laborima@gmail.com>  Sat, 08 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0200

